## portus — framework HTTP para PenguScript.
##
## Un servidor HTTP/1.1 completo sobre `poll(2)` y llhttp, con la API de un
## framework de rutas: `Application`, `Context`, `Handler` y un `HttpError` como
## valor. Sin closures: los handlers son `weave`s con nombre.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## import std.spark
## import portus
##
## weave hello with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
##     calling context.send_text with "hola"
##     return calling portus.ok_void
##
## weave main into int:
##     var app as portus.Application is calling portus.new_application
##     let added as result of void to portus.route.PatternError is calling portus.get with sigil of app, "/", hello
##     let served as result of int to string is calling portus.serve with sigil of app, 3000
##     return 0
## ```
##
## ## Memoria
## `Application` es dueña de sus rutas: libérala con `portus.application.free_application`.
## El servidor presta la aplicación mientras corre.
import portus.cookie as cookie_alias_module
import portus.application as application_module
import portus.context as context_module
import portus.group as group_module
import portus.error
import portus.handler as handler_module
import portus.middleware as middleware_module
import portus.route as route_module
import portus.static_file as static_module
import portus.compress as compress_module
import portus.negotiation as negotiation_module
import portus.transport as transport
import portus.query as query_alias_module
import portus.text as text_module

alias Application as application_module.Application
alias Context as context_module.Context
alias Handler as handler_module.Handler
alias Params as route_module.Params
alias PatternError as route_module.PatternError
alias Request as transport.Request
alias Response as transport.Response
alias ServeOptions as transport.ServeOptions
alias HttpError as error.HttpError
alias ErrorHandler as handler_module.ErrorHandler
alias Middleware as handler_module.Middleware
alias MiddlewareFn as handler_module.MiddlewareFn
alias AppHook as application_module.AppHook
alias Group as group_module.Group
alias Cookies as cookie_alias_module.Cookies
alias CookieOptions as cookie_alias_module.CookieOptions
alias Queries as query_alias_module.Query

## Copia propia de una cadena (para guardar datos que sobreviven a la petición).
weave text_copy with value as string into string:
    return calling text_module.copy with value

## Posición de `needle` en `value`, o `-1`.
weave text_index with value as string, needle as string into int:
    return calling text_module.index_of with value, needle

## Prefijo de `value` hasta `index`.
weave text_before with value as string, index as int into string:
    return calling text_module.take_before with value, index

## Sufijo de `value` tras `index`.
weave text_after with value as string, index as int into string:
    return calling text_module.take_after with value, index

## Versión del paquete.
const PORTUS_VERSION as string is "0.1.0"

## Crea una aplicación vacía.
weave new_application into Application:
    return calling application_module.new_application

## Opciones de arranque por defecto (`127.0.0.1:3000`).
weave default_options into ServeOptions:
    return calling transport.base_options

## `result of void to HttpError` con éxito.
weave ok_void into result of void to HttpError:
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

## `result of void to HttpError` con fallo.
weave err_void with failure as HttpError into result of void to HttpError:
    return calling handler_module.err_void with failure

## Registra una ruta `GET`.
weave get with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "GET", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `OPTIONS`.
weave options with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "OPTIONS", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `POST`.
weave post with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "POST", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `PUT`.
weave put with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "PUT", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `PATCH`.
weave patch with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "PATCH", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `DELETE`.
weave delete with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "DELETE", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `HEAD`.
weave head with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "HEAD", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta para cualquier método.
weave any with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "*", pattern, handler

## Arranca el servidor en `port` y bloquea. Devuelve el puerto real.
##
## ## Memoria
## La aplicación debe vivir mientras el servidor corre.
weave serve with app as ref to Application, port as int into result of int to string:
    var options as ServeOptions is calling transport.base_options
    set options.port is port
    return calling application_module.serve_with with app, options

## Crea un grupo de rutas bajo `prefix` (`"/api"`).
##
## ## Memoria
## El `Group` presta la aplicación: no la libera ni la copia.
weave new_group with app as ref to Application, prefix as string into Group:
    return calling group_module.group_with_prefix with app, prefix

## Envuelve una función de middleware en un `Middleware` con su `data`.
weave middleware with invoke as MiddlewareFn into Middleware:
    return calling handler_module.middleware with invoke

## Añade un middleware para todas las rutas.
weave use with app as ref to Application, layer as Middleware into void:
    return calling application_module.use with app, layer

## Añade un middleware solo bajo `prefix`.
weave use_at with app as ref to Application, prefix as string, layer as Middleware into void:
    return calling application_module.use_at with app, prefix, layer

## Añade un middleware que corre después de la ruta.
weave after with app as ref to Application, layer as Middleware into void:
    return calling application_module.after with app, layer

## Registra el manejador de errores de la aplicación.
weave on_error with app as ref to Application, handler as ErrorHandler into void:
    return calling application_module.on_error with app, handler

## Registra el manejador de rutas no encontradas.
weave on_not_found with app as ref to Application, handler as Handler into void:
    return calling application_module.on_not_found with app, handler

## Registra un hook que corre al arrancar.
weave on_start with app as ref to Application, hook as AppHook into void:
    return calling application_module.on_start with app, hook

## Registra un hook que corre al apagar.
weave on_shutdown with app as ref to Application, hook as AppHook into void:
    return calling application_module.on_shutdown with app, hook

## Código de estado HTTP de un `HttpError`.
weave status_of with failure as HttpError into int:
    return calling error.status_of with failure

## Crea un `HttpError` 400.
weave bad_request with message as string into HttpError:
    return calling error.bad_request with message

## Crea un `HttpError` 404.
weave not_found into HttpError:
    return calling error.not_found

## Crea un `HttpError` 500.
weave internal_error into HttpError:
    return calling error.internal

## Añade `X-Request-Id` aleatorio a cada respuesta.
weave use_request_id with app as ref to Application into void:
    return calling middleware_module.add_request_id with app

## Añade las cabeceras de seguridad habituales.
weave use_security_headers with app as ref to Application into void:
    return calling middleware_module.add_security_headers with app

## Añade CORS para `origin`.
weave use_cors with app as ref to Application, origin as string into void:
    return calling middleware_module.add_cors with app, origin

## Añade un log de una línea por petición.
weave use_logger with app as ref to Application into void:
    return calling middleware_module.add_logger with app

## Ping del binding nativo (humo de instalación).
## Negociación: `true` si el cliente acepta `media_type`.
weave accepts with context as ref to context_module.Context, media_type as string into bool:
    return calling negotiation_module.accepts with context, media_type

## Negociación: mejor tipo de `offered`, o `none`.
weave best with context as ref to context_module.Context, offered as list of string into maybe string:
    return calling negotiation_module.best with context, offered

## Comprime con gzip las respuestas que lo acepten.
weave use_compress with app as ref to application_module.Application into void:
    calling application_module.after with app, (calling handler_module.middleware_with with compress_module._compress, (transmute 0 to ref to void))
    return

## Sirve `root` bajo `prefix` (`"/static"`; `""` para la raíz).
weave mount_static with app as ref to application_module.Application, prefix as string, root as string into result of void to route_module.PatternError:
    return calling static_module.mount with app, prefix, root

weave ping with n as int into int:
    return calling transport.native_ping with n

# --- WebSocket ------------------------------------------------------------

import portus.websocket as websocket_module

## Conexión WebSocket viva.
alias WebSocketConn as websocket_module.Conn

## Handler WebSocket con estado.
alias WebSocketHandler as websocket_module.SocketHandler

## Función que recibe cada mensaje WebSocket.
alias WebSocketMessageFn as websocket_module.MessageFn

## Construye un handler WebSocket con estado.
weave ws_handler with invoke as WebSocketMessageFn, data as ref to void into websocket_module.SocketHandler:
    return calling websocket_module.handler_with with invoke, data

## Texto de un mensaje WebSocket (copia propia).
weave ws_text with payload as ref to frozen byte, length as int into string:
    return calling websocket_module.text_of with payload, length

## Acepta la conexión WebSocket de esta petición.
weave ws_upgrade with context as ref to Context, handler as WebSocketHandler into bool:
    return calling websocket_module.upgrade with context, handler

# --- Sesiones -------------------------------------------------------------

import portus.session as session_module

## Sesión de una petición (cookie firmada).
alias Session as session_module.Session

## Fija el secreto de firma y la vida de las sesiones.
weave sessions_configure with secret as string, ttl_ms as long into void:
    calling session_module.configure with secret, ttl_ms
    return

## Carga la sesión de la petición, si la hay y es válida.
weave sessions_load with context as ref to Context into maybe session_module.Session:
    return calling session_module.load with context

## Empieza una sesión nueva.
weave sessions_start with context as ref to Context into session_module.Session:
    return calling session_module.start with context

## Lee un valor de la sesión.
weave sessions_get with session as ref to session_module.Session, name as string into maybe string:
    return calling session_module.get with session, name

## Escribe un valor en la sesión.
weave sessions_set with session as ref to session_module.Session, name as string, value as string into void:
    calling session_module.set with session, name, value
    return

## Guarda la sesión y manda la cookie.
weave sessions_save with context as ref to Context, session as ref to session_module.Session into void:
    calling session_module.save with context, session
    return

## Borra la sesión y su cookie.
weave sessions_destroy with context as ref to Context, session as ref to session_module.Session into void:
    calling session_module.destroy with context, session
    return

# --- Seguridad ------------------------------------------------------------

import portus.auth as auth_module
import portus.csrf as csrf_module
import portus.rate_limit as rate_limit_module

## Autentica Basic; si falla deja `WWW-Authenticate: Basic`.
weave basic_auth with context as ref to Context, user as string, password as string into maybe string:
    return calling auth_module.basic with context, user, password

## Token Bearer de la petición.
weave bearer_auth with context as ref to Context into maybe string:
    return calling auth_module.bearer with context

## Comprueba un Bearer fijo.
weave bearer_required with context as ref to Context, expected as string into bool:
    return calling auth_module.bearer_is with context, expected

## Firma un JWT HS256.
weave jwt_sign with secret as string, claims as string into string:
    return calling auth_module.sign_hs256 with secret, claims

## Verifica la firma de un JWT HS256.
weave jwt_verify with secret as string, token as string into bool:
    return calling auth_module.verify_hs256 with secret, token

## Claims de un JWT HS256 válido.
weave jwt_claims with secret as string, token as string into maybe string:
    return calling auth_module.claims with secret, token

## Claims del Bearer JWT de la petición, si la firma cuadra.
weave jwt_bearer with context as ref to Context, secret as string into maybe string:
    return calling auth_module.bearer_jwt with context, secret

## Token CSRF de la petición (crea cookie si falta).
weave issue_csrf_token with context as ref to Context into string:
    return calling csrf_module.token with context

## `true` si la cabecera CSRF coincide con la cookie.
weave csrf_ok with context as ref to Context into bool:
    return calling csrf_module.check with context

## Rechaza con 403 las peticiones que cambian estado sin CSRF válido.
weave csrf_protect with context as ref to Context into result of void to HttpError:
    return calling csrf_module.guard with context

## Limita las peticiones por cliente (ventana fija).
weave use_rate_limit with app as ref to Application, max_requests as int, window_ms as long into void:
    calling rate_limit_module.use with app, max_requests, window_ms
    return

## Limita las peticiones bajo `prefix`.
weave use_rate_limit_at with app as ref to Application, prefix as string, max_requests as int, window_ms as long into void:
    calling rate_limit_module.use_at with app, prefix, max_requests, window_ms
    return

## Añade la cabecera `Content-Security-Policy`.
weave use_csp with app as ref to Application, policy as string into void:
    calling middleware_module.use_csp with app, policy
    return

# --- Multipart ------------------------------------------------------------

import portus.multipart as multipart_module

## Parte de un formulario `multipart/form-data`.
alias MultipartPart as multipart_module.Part

## Primera parte con ese nombre.
weave multipart_part with parts as list of MultipartPart, name as string into maybe MultipartPart:
    return calling multipart_module.part_named with parts, name

## Libera una parte.
weave free_multipart_part with part as MultipartPart into void:
    calling multipart_module.free_part with part
    return

## Libera una lista de partes.
weave free_multipart with parts as list of MultipartPart into void:
    calling multipart_module.free_parts with parts
    return
